2:10.0, and 80 km in 1-22:42.0. However, by 60 km, Bouhours was starting a steady attack to gain back time. Chase went through 90 km in 1-34:11.4, still in the lead, but Bouhours caught him with nine laps remaining, or at 95.5 km. Chase had enough left to hang on to Bouhours and ride with him to the final lap, when he managed to summon enough energy to win the final sprint, defeating Bouhours by only 4/10ths of a second. For winning, Chase won 2,000 francs, with Bouhours receiving 1,200, and third-place finisher " [:a {:href "/athletes/891548"} "Édouard Taylor"] ", who was well back, 800 francs."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/890299"} "Arthur Chase"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "1-46:09.2"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/890172"} "Émile Bouhours"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "1-46:09.6"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/891548"} "Édouard Taylor"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "1-47:26.2"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/891412"} "Thaddäus Robl"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.co